# Designed flow; arrows show order/guards, not checked temporal guarantees.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Search root field\nworkspace:read before inspection" {class: start}
Reserve: "Validate + reserve per root\nRoot / policy / depth / stop records\nMatch slots have separate room"
Admission: "Five app defaults · review pending\nFixed-region Preboot; read-write/read-only APFS\nFile default: Koine home; no link traversal"
Skip: "Blocked / unsupported / absent\nExact target + reason; no consent probe\nOptional default absence: empty domain"
Scan: "Cyclic root turns · 64 entries\nDepth-first held streams · 32 frames / root\nNo root spends another root's credits"
Bounds: "DIAGNOSTIC_LIMIT: total record / byte room\nVALUE_LIMIT: an individual path bound\nStop: REMAINDER with or without progress"
Coverage: "One coverage object per root\nCOMPLETE → searched SUBTREE\nProgress otherwise → OBSERVED_DESCENDANTS"
Groups: "Root depth group counts encountered anchors\nNames can match; descendants skipped\nInvalid / overlong: parent group omits name too"
Available: "Any progress → AVAILABLE\nRanked matches; truncation ≠ coverage\nFixed match slots preserve diagnostic room"
Blocked: "No progress, no failure + prompt risk\nBLOCKED: null matches + dependency\nNo search-generated error; UNKNOWN consent"
Other: "No progress: inspection / change / work refusal\nFAILED first; absence / exclusion → dependency\nUncertain inspection: INSPECTION_FAILED"
Publish: "Publish under live read authority\nLifecycle / denial can suppress selected fields\nStatus never waives errors; acceptance pending"
Start -> Reserve: "1 · valid input"
Reserve -> Admission: "2 · owned budgets"
Admission -> Skip: "3 · refused scope"
Admission -> Scan: "3 · admitted names"
Scan -> Bounds: "4 · unfinished work"
Skip -> Coverage: "5 · diagnostic only"
Scan -> Coverage: "5 · EOF / observations"
Bounds -> Coverage: "5 · frozen remainder"
Coverage -> Groups: "6 · exact extent semantics"
Groups -> Available: "7 · some progress"
Groups -> Blocked: "7 · prompt risk, no failure"
Groups -> Other: "7 · other no-progress causes"
Available -> Publish: "8 · matches + coverage"
Blocked -> Publish: "8 · typed data; field errors still apply"
Other -> Publish: "8 · distinct outcome"
